1107
01:36:25,704 --> 01:36:27,206
Professor Kwon?

1108
01:36:29,708 --> 01:36:31,540
You sent this invitation, didn't you?

1109
01:36:32,881 --> 01:36:35,610
My inspiration to create these children

1110
01:36:35,634 --> 01:36:37,846
came from you, Professor Kwon.

1111
01:36:41,300 --> 01:36:44,303
My dad begged you.

1112
01:36:49,058 --> 01:36:50,535
To Prof. Kwon: Imperfect communication,

1113
01:36:50,559 --> 01:36:51,497
the source of all tragedy.

1114
01:36:51,521 --> 01:36:53,362
Se-jeong, this is a misunderstanding.

1115
01:36:53,442 --> 01:36:56,065
The law doesn't always match the actual situation.

1116
01:36:56,695 --> 01:36:59,198
Borrowing the name of students who didn't take part

1117
01:36:59,368 --> 01:37:02,621
was the only way to pay students who did participate.

1118
01:37:02,871 --> 01:37:04,623
They all agreed to it.

1119
01:37:04,873 --> 01:37:07,222
No, no, Se-jeong...

1120
01:37:07,246 --> 01:37:11,170
This is a tragedy resulting from imperfect communication.

1121
01:37:12,251 --> 01:37:13,292
No, please.

1122
01:37:13,632 --> 01:37:15,043
Se-jeong... Se-jeong?

1123
01:37:29,898 --> 01:37:33,102
And so, all of this was because of that incident?

1124
01:37:34,403 --> 01:37:36,655
If you want revenge, take it out on me, asshole!

1125
01:37:37,606 --> 01:37:38,817
What What revenge?

1126
01:37:40,159 --> 01:37:42,111
My dad's death

1127
01:37:44,113 --> 01:37:47,035
was a tragedy caused by imperfect communication.

1128
01:37:47,616 --> 01:37:49,724
Not because of someone like you.

1129
01:37:49,748 --> 01:37:53,212
Like you... like you...

1130
01:37:55,294 --> 01:37:57,926
Compared to the great achievements of mankind,

1131
01:37:58,087 --> 01:37:59,234
the knowledge possessed

1132
01:37:59,258 --> 01:38:01,340
by any individual is incredibly limited.

1133
01:38:01,930 --> 01:38:06,595
That limitation creates a state of terrible incomprehension.

1134
01:38:07,636 --> 01:38:10,479
In the end, the way to stop all such tragedies

1135
01:38:10,849 --> 01:38:15,194
is to connect all of our minds together.

1136
01:38:16,775 --> 01:38:19,278
The imperfect communication of human beings,

1137
01:38:19,648 --> 01:38:21,490
all the tragedies that result from

1138
01:38:21,530 --> 01:38:23,782
not fully understanding what others feel.

1139
01:38:24,533 --> 01:38:26,785
This system is the perfect solution.

1140
01:38:27,866 --> 01:38:29,868
That's what we are.

1141
01:38:32,081 --> 01:38:36,255
What do less evolved beings like you have over us?

1142
01:38:37,256 --> 01:38:38,377
Ah...

1143
01:38:39,218 --> 01:38:41,260
The freedom to be an outcast?

1144
01:38:42,841 --> 01:38:44,973
Can you handle that, Professor?

1145
01:38:46,555 --> 01:38:48,637
You do this because you can handle it?

1146
01:38:49,808 --> 01:38:52,020
Then go ahead, be an outcast.

1147
01:39:02,691 --> 01:39:04,323
Alpha Team, target located.

1148
01:39:16,165 --> 01:39:18,417
Alpha Team, vaccine secured! Vaccine secured!

1149
01:39:18,707 --> 01:39:20,669
If target's secured, withdraw quickly!

1150
01:39:52,121 --> 01:39:55,544
Well, it's a shame, but at least we've got the vaccine...

1151
01:39:57,916 --> 01:39:59,458
Then what about her?

1152
01:39:59,998 --> 01:40:01,960
You're just going to abandon her?

1153
01:40:02,381 --> 01:40:04,713
Send the rescue team back in now!

1154
01:40:05,174 --> 01:40:06,635
Okay, everyone...

1155
01:40:06,755 --> 01:40:08,807
Professor, get some rest, okay?

1156
01:40:09,058 --> 01:40:10,849
Think your job here is done.

1157
01:40:11,060 --> 01:40:13,512
Escort the professor out. Back to your places.

1158
01:40:13,602 --> 01:40:15,434
- This way, please. - Let go!

1159
01:40:18,016 --> 01:40:20,205
Alpha Team moving to Building C Rooftop.

1160
01:40:20,229 --> 01:40:22,941
Roger. Charlie Team ready to move to adjacent building.

1161
01:40:38,917 --> 01:40:42,091
My Better Half.

1162
01:40:46,215 --> 01:40:47,506
Hello?

1163
01:40:47,716 --> 01:40:51,180
Hello? Professor Kwon? Are you okay?

1164
01:40:52,391 --> 01:40:55,013
I know your situation there.

1165
01:40:55,354 --> 01:40:56,935
You know my situation?

1166
01:40:57,806 --> 01:41:01,730
I was watching from the Counterterrorism HQ.

1167
01:41:02,651 --> 01:41:03,732
I'm sorry.

1168
01:41:04,273 --> 01:41:07,236
I don't think the rescue team can go back.

1169
01:41:10,119 --> 01:41:12,821
Then why are you calling me?

1170
01:41:15,284 --> 01:41:18,036
I thought I had found a way to stop the infected.

1171
01:41:18,627 --> 01:41:21,960
There was a group of monkeys Suh experimented on at his lab.

1172
01:41:22,131 --> 01:41:24,753
When a monkey marked

1173
01:41:24,923 --> 01:41:27,466
all the other monkeys stopped moving.

1174
01:41:27,586 --> 01:41:28,587
They stopped moving?

1175
01:41:29,178 --> 01:41:31,566
So I thought killing the first infected

1176
01:41:31,590 --> 01:41:33,222
would solve everything...

1177
01:41:41,190 --> 01:41:42,901
The monkey marked.

1178
01:41:43,102 --> 01:41:45,234
It's not the first one to be infected.

1179
01:41:45,484 --> 01:41:47,696
It's the monkey that controls all the others.

1180
01:41:47,856 --> 01:41:50,109
In that case, monkey.

1181
01:41:51,110 --> 01:41:52,861
Suh Young-chul himself.

1182
01:41:53,452 --> 01:41:55,784
Alpha Team arriving at destination.

1183
01:41:55,994 --> 01:41:57,616
Have you ever been shot?

1184
01:41:58,457 --> 01:41:59,618
Eyes forward.

1185
01:42:21,390 --> 01:42:23,062
I'm so sore.

1186
01:42:44,663 --> 01:42:46,441
Tell them to kill Suh Young-chul immediately.

1187
01:42:46,465 --> 01:42:49,088
That'll stop all of them from moving.

1188
01:42:49,508 --> 01:42:51,880
If Suh gets outside, we're finished!

1189
01:42:52,881 --> 01:42:55,804
We can't. If we kill him now,

1190
01:42:56,175 --> 01:42:58,267
not only the victims' families,

1191
01:42:58,637 --> 01:43:00,785
but everyone scared of getting infected

1192
01:43:00,809 --> 01:43:02,181
will become our enemies.

1193
01:43:02,231 --> 01:43:04,683
The government won't easily make that decision.

1194
01:43:05,774 --> 01:43:07,606
Can you handle that?

1195
01:43:08,107 --> 01:43:10,489
Then go ahead, be an outcast.

1196
01:43:12,531 --> 01:43:14,193
So that's what he meant.

1197
01:43:30,089 --> 01:43:31,920
Is he really the vaccine?

1198
01:43:32,881 --> 01:43:36,175
Never mind what others think, what do you think?

1199
01:43:38,967 --> 01:43:40,849
You have to decide.

1200
01:43:56,615 --> 01:43:59,368
Any issues bringing Suh Young-chul outside?

1201
01:43:59,788 --> 01:44:02,831
No, Suh Young-chul is coming out safely.

1202
01:44:11,880 --> 01:44:13,592
We need to eliminate Suh Young-chul!

1203
01:44:14,463 --> 01:44:15,884
What are you talking about?

1204
01:44:16,135 --> 01:44:18,387
I called Professor Kwon who's in the building now,

1205
01:44:18,557 --> 01:44:21,696
and she said Suh is controlling all of the infected.

1206
01:44:21,720 --> 01:44:22,811
Suh Young-chul is.

1207
01:44:22,891 --> 01:44:24,433
We need to kill him.

1208
01:44:24,893 --> 01:44:27,516
Seriously? Kill the vaccine?

1209
01:44:29,268 --> 01:44:30,899
Your responsibility extends only

1210
01:44:30,939 --> 01:44:32,941
to that operation that failed earlier!

1211
01:44:33,232 --> 01:44:35,170
Does anyone have clear evidence

1212
01:44:35,194 --> 01:44:37,486
that we need to kill our only vaccine?

1213
01:44:37,526 --> 01:44:38,987
Anyone? Anyone have it?

1214
01:44:41,410 --> 01:44:45,334
The vaccine is on his way here now. It's all finished!

1215
01:44:47,876 --> 01:44:50,765
HQ, lifting lockdown here. One SWAT vehicle moving.

1216
01:44:50,789 --> 01:44:52,631
The vaccine is being moved to the safe zone.

1217
01:44:53,922 --> 01:44:56,795
HQ, vehicle has entered! I repeat, vehicle has entered!

1218
01:45:03,802 --> 01:45:05,434
Too many people are gathered in front

1219
01:45:05,474 --> 01:45:07,266
of Doongwoori Building. Support needed.

1220
01:45:07,606 --> 01:45:09,284
Requesting all available personnel

1221
01:45:09,308 --> 01:45:11,110
to be sent to Doongwoori Building.

1222
01:47:06,055 --> 01:47:08,427
Secure the area! Move back!

1223
01:47:08,977 --> 01:47:10,599
Stop, please. Move back.

1224
01:47:10,729 --> 01:47:12,351
Move back, move back!

1225
01:47:46,885 --> 01:47:48,427
Minister!

1226
01:47:54,022 --> 01:47:55,250
The barricade in front of.

1227
01:47:55,274 --> 01:47:57,226
Doongwoori Building is being breached!

1228
01:47:57,476 --> 01:47:58,687
What?

1229
01:48:25,634 --> 01:48:26,885
Come on.

1230
01:48:33,562 --> 01:48:36,265
No... we need to get Suh.

1231
01:48:36,395 --> 01:48:38,187
Where are the nearest army units?

1232
01:48:38,937 --> 01:48:42,731
All the troops in Seoul are mobilized in there.

1233
01:48:44,233 --> 01:48:45,324
Damn it!

1234
01:48:45,574 --> 01:48:48,827
Listen, everyone. Let's disband for now, okay?

1235
01:48:48,867 --> 01:48:51,370
We'll decide the HQ's new location later.

1236
01:48:51,410 --> 01:48:53,242
Everyone evacuate, quickly!

1237
01:49:33,322 --> 01:49:34,413
Hello?

1238
01:49:34,743 --> 01:49:36,575
What happened to Suh?

1239
01:49:37,286 --> 01:49:39,668
The people in charge here are all running away.

1240
01:49:39,918 --> 01:49:41,670
And Suh Young-chul escaped.

1241
01:49:43,252 --> 01:49:46,295
Can you check Suh's location? You said you saw everything.

1242
01:49:46,385 --> 01:49:48,797
Just a minute. I'll call you right back.

1243
01:49:50,139 --> 01:49:51,300
Professor Gong.

1244
01:49:52,010 --> 01:49:53,222
Professor Gong!

1245
01:50:04,022 --> 01:50:05,484
Do we know Suh's location?

1246
01:50:05,524 --> 01:50:06,524
What?

1247
01:50:06,775 --> 01:50:08,197
What are you doing?

1248
01:50:08,487 --> 01:50:09,568
You need to evacuate!

1249
01:50:09,818 --> 01:50:11,570
There's no time! Go, quickly!

1250
01:50:24,173 --> 01:50:25,374
I found him.

1251
01:50:26,255 --> 01:50:28,217
He's at 32 Sinsok Street, on the main road.

1252
01:50:31,880 --> 01:50:33,722
See the car with blinking lights?

1253
01:50:34,183 --> 01:50:35,134
See it.

1254
01:50:35,184 --> 01:50:36,345
I'm watching.

1255
01:50:39,308 --> 01:50:40,979
Tell me which way to go.

1256
01:50:48,147 --> 01:50:49,294
Keep going straight.

1257
01:50:49,318 --> 01:50:50,638
Keep going straight. Jalan terus.

1258
01:50:51,820 --> 01:50:53,402
Left at the intersection.

1259
01:50:59,368 --> 01:51:00,808
Turn right at the next intersection.

1260
01:53:09,538 --> 01:53:11,420
That idiot, covering himself in that...

1261
01:53:18,797 --> 01:53:19,888
Move!

1262
01:53:22,431 --> 01:53:24,513
Out of the way!

1263
01:53:50,499 --> 01:53:51,819
Reverted to their original state.

1264
01:54:38,427 --> 01:54:40,509
Stop! Stop, you bastards!

1265
01:54:41,130 --> 01:54:42,471
Stop!

1266
01:54:55,314 --> 01:54:57,356
Please stop!

1267
01:55:03,612 --> 01:55:04,612
Stop!

1268
01:55:04,823 --> 01:55:05,994
Please...

1269
01:56:54,683 --> 01:56:55,331
Yes?

1270
01:56:55,355 --> 01:56:57,606
How's it in other places? Was it successful?

1271
01:57:00,689 --> 01:57:02,271
They've stopped.

1272
01:57:03,732 --> 01:57:05,404
You did it.

1273
01:57:06,405 --> 01:57:09,158
I doubt people will see it that way.

1274
01:57:10,028 --> 01:57:11,490
What should we do?

1275
01:57:11,660 --> 01:57:13,808
The vaccine's gone for good now.

1276
01:57:13,832 --> 01:57:15,874
Everyone's going to hate me.

1277
01:57:17,246 --> 01:57:18,627
Don't worry.

1278
01:57:18,747 --> 01:57:21,250
I'll testify with you.

1279
01:57:21,750 --> 01:57:25,043
If you're going to be hated, I'll take it with you.

1280
01:57:30,849 --> 01:57:32,681
No need for that.

1281
01:57:32,851 --> 01:57:34,603
I'm used to people hating me.

1282
01:57:36,645 --> 01:57:38,357
Where are you now?

1283
01:57:39,648 --> 01:57:42,231
I guess we have a lot of work ahead of us.




